            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A surgical handpiece is provided. The surgical handpiece comprises a housing (50), an electrical component (19) within the housing; and a thermal diffuser (100) disposed between the housing and the electrical component and comprising a thermal conductive layer (110) and an electrical insulating layer (120). The thermal conductive layer is closer to the housing than the electrical insulating layer, and the thermal conductive layer and the electrical insulating layer are bonded with an adhesive.</p>
            </abstract>
